<Layout title="Billie Eilish 2025">
  <LinkList slot="sidebar" items={musicConcerts} orientation="vertical" />

  <p>Billie Eilish came to finish up her Hit Me Hard and Soft tour in San Francisco in November 2025. I went
  to the concert with my mom. We saw her on the next to last night. I had been listening to the concert set
  list for the previous month and knew the whole set list</p>
 
  <p> The whole show was a spectacle and it was my favorite concert ever.</p>

   <YouTube
  id="fAdEZqwMj7s"
  title="Full concert video of Billie"
  caption="My favorite song's performance begins at 53:53 with Not Strong Enough."
/>



</Layout>

